# Physical input isolated for this exact dedicated game, through owned shutdown.
# Synthetic city support: 50 enrolled bodies, 18 authored tent rows via setup-only calendar completion,
# 3600 additional drams, 1728 food, foundry knowledge, one supplemental granary stockpile.
# Tent rows: 16 of the accepted grid plus transposed 4x6 lots (16,3)-(19,8) and (74,2)-(77,7);
# (74,9)-(77,14) is the spare. Every row uses the retained S canvas binding (housing-s-canvas,
# Retained=yes), not exercised natively since tentrow moved to Medium lots (561bffd3); neither are the
# transposed poses nor the east lot's lane to the zone edge (x 78-79).
# Paid-tent script (#282): the camp mints 13 brush (Medium tent 12 + its canvas-only upgrade 2 - 1), not
# the plain case's 23, so one sentinel brush survives the tent, too few for its own upgrade before hold.
# Founder walks west then one row south (cell derived from the catalogue tent lot). The real commission
# is quoted first and must name the source tent (22,6)-(29,11) with labour inside one paid day; only then
# is its other input (one disclosed timber) minted and the tent paid against that quote. Its reserved
# lane must clear the final heart.
# The source paid tent completes during an ordinary day, then its improvement is held.
# All non-heart improvements held before the exact next heart material bill is supplied per leg.
# At paid handover, place a real resident on annexed and renovated interior wall ground; protect founder/stranger,
# force no destination, then require safe clearance and a distinct stranger-obstruction retry.
# Paid heart improvements use ordinary turns only. No higher-rung save/load or ordinary-play acceptance.
DESCRIPTION=paid heart 1->2->3->4 with supported synthetic city, exact costs and original basin/stockpile custody
REQUEST=founding-first-city
START=8.22@40,12
SCRIPT=stagedigest;camp-heart-setup;advance 1200;camp-heart-check;advance 3600;camp-heart-check;advance 1200;camp-heart-check;stagedigest;camp-heart-chain-setup;advance 1200;camp-heart-chain-supply;advance 1200;camp-heart-chain-check;advance 7200;camp-heart-chain-check;camp-heart-chain-supply;advance 1200;camp-heart-chain-check;advance 6600;advance 6600;camp-heart-chain-check;advance 1200;camp-heart-chain-check
VERBS=camp-heart-setup,camp-heart-check,camp-heart-chain-setup,camp-heart-chain-check,camp-heart-chain-supply
EXPECT=camp-heart-chain-input:OK~original-update-skipped=true,stagedigest:OK~founded=false,camp-heart-setup:OK~native-camp-heart phase=1,advance:OK,camp-heart-check:OK~native-camp-heart phase=2,advance:OK,camp-heart-check:OK~native-camp-heart phase=3,advance:OK,camp-heart-check:OK~native-camp-heart cases=1 passed=1 failed=0,stagedigest:OK~founded=true,camp-heart-chain-founder:OK~outside-rung4=true,camp-heart-chain-setup:OK~paid-heart-chain setup,advance:OK,camp-heart-chain-spatial:OK,camp-heart-chain-occupancy:OK~synthetic-placement=true; retained-walkable=true; scoped-assessment=true,camp-heart-chain-road-wear:OK~worn-trodden-path-admitted=true,camp-heart-chain-supply:OK~target=3,advance:OK,camp-heart-chain-check:OK~paid-heart-chain paid; target=3,advance:OK,camp-heart-chain-handover-refusals:OK~post-payment-resident=true,camp-heart-chain-handover-cleared:OK~post-payment-resident=true,camp-heart-chain-retry-obstruction:OK~strict-baseline=true,camp-heart-chain-retry-outstanding:OK~phase=Outstanding,camp-heart-chain-retry-removal:OK~committed-removal-reproved=true,camp-heart-chain-check:OK~paid-heart-chain completed; rung=3,camp-heart-chain-renovation:OK~retained-new-wall=true; resident-preflight=true; scoped-assessment=true,camp-heart-chain-survey-stakes:OK~four-exact-stakes=true; founding-recovery-restored=true,camp-heart-chain-supply:OK~target=4,advance:OK,camp-heart-chain-check:OK~paid-heart-chain paid; target=4,advance:OK,advance:OK,camp-heart-chain-renovation-refusals:OK~post-payment-resident=true,camp-heart-chain-renovation-cleared:OK~post-payment-resident=true,camp-heart-chain-check:OK~paid-heart-chain completed; rung=4,advance:OK,camp-heart-chain-check:OK~paid-heart-chain complete;,COMPLETE
